OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain across England will move
OL,6,Feastwards through the day, with
OL,7,Fbrighter skies following in the west.
OL,8,FSunshine and showers across the rest
OL,9,Fof the UK, these heavy across
OL,10,FScotland. Feeling colder for many,
OL,11,Fwith a brisk northerly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain clearing southeast
OL,14,FEngland during the evening. Clear
OL,15,Fspells and showers elsewhere, with
OL,16,Fshowers tending to become confined to
OL,17,Fcoastal stretches overnight. Chilly,
OL,18,Fwith a patchy frost in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
