OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA chilly, though mostly
OL,6,Fsunny morning. Cloud increasing in the
OL,7,Fwest, with rain moving in across
OL,8,Fwestern areas by the afternoon, with
OL,9,Fincreasingly gusty winds in the north.
